+---------------+----------+--------------+--------------+-----------------+---------------+----------------+---------+------------------+------------------+---------+---------+
|    pll_hdmi   | PLL_BR0  |    B1,R0     |     core     |     CLK_25M     |     local     |       FB       |    FB   | hdmi_tx_slow_clk | hdmi_tx_fast_clk |         |         |
+---------------+----------+--------------+--------------+-----------------+---------------+----------------+---------+------------------+------------------+---------+---------+

Instance Name                 : pll_hdmi
Resource                      : PLL_BR0
Locked Pin Name               : hdmi_tx_locked
Clock Source                  : core
Reference Clock               : CLK_25M
Feedback Mode                 : local
Feedback Clock                : FB

Reference Clock Frequency     : 25.0000 MHz
Reference Clock Period        : 40.0000 ns
Multiplier (M)                : 1
Pre-Divider (N)               : 1
VCO Frequency                 : 2975.0000 MHz
Post-Divider (O)              : 1
PLL Frequency                 : 2975.0000 MHz

Output Clock 0
Clock Pin Name                : FB
Output Divider                : 119
Dynamic Phase Shift           : Disable
Phase Setting                 : 0
Phase Degree                  : 0.0000
Invert Output                 : false
Output Frequency              : 25.0000 MHz
Output Period                 : 40.000 ns

Output Clock 1
Clock Pin Name                : hdmi_tx_slow_clk
Output Divider                : 20
Dynamic Phase Shift           : Disable
Phase Setting                 : 0
Phase Degree                  : 0.0000
Invert Output                 : false
Output Frequency              : 148.7500 MHz
Output Period                 : 6.723 ns

Output Clock 2
Clock Pin Name                : hdmi_tx_fast_clk
Output Divider                : 4
Dynamic Phase Shift           : Disable
Phase Setting                 : 2
Phase Degree                  : 90.0000
Invert Output                 : false
Output Frequency              : 743.7500 MHz
Output Period                 : 1.345 ns

Frequency calculations:
	VCO = REFCLK * ((M * FBK) /N)
	    = 25.0000 MHz * ((1*119) /1)
	    = 2975.0000 MHz
	PLL = VCO / O
	    = 2975.0000 MHz / 1
	    = 2975.0000 MHz

	CLKOUT0 = PLL / CLKOUT0_DIV
	        = 2975.0000 MHz / 119
	        = 25.0000 MHz
	CLKOUT1 = PLL / CLKOUT1_DIV
	        = 2975.0000 MHz / 20
	        = 148.7500 MHz
	CLKOUT2 = PLL / CLKOUT2_DIV
	        = 2975.0000 MHz / 4
	        = 743.7500 MHz

SDC Constraints:
	create_clock -period 40.000 -name FB [get_ports {FB}]
	create_clock -period 6.723 -name hdmi_tx_slow_clk [get_ports {hdmi_tx_slow_clk}]
	create_clock -waveform {0.336 1.009} -period 1.345 -name hdmi_tx_fast_clk [get_ports {hdmi_tx_fast_clk}]

